[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナには、いつも助けられてきた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She's always been there to help me.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（強くて、優しくて、ホントに頼りになる人）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She's strong, kind, and so dependable.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だからこそ、今回は勝ちたい！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That's exactly why I want to win this time!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（絶対、負けられないんだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I absolutely can't lose.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢さんからのご招待だよ。\n「年末年始は、ぜひケイウンに来るといい」って！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya invited us! He said, \"You should definitely come to Keiun for the new year!\""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "オォーウやった。ご招待！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, awesome! An invitation!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもさ、年末年始ってことは、\nケイウンでは何か特別なことでもあるのかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But wait, new year's... Does that mean there's something special happening in Keiun?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本で読んだんだけどね、ケイウンでは年末年始に\n色んな特別な催し物が行われるんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I read in a book that Keiun holds all sorts of special events around the new year."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "社に新年のお参りをしたり、\n身近な人たちで集まって、おせちを食べたり……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "People visit shrines for new year prayers, gather with those close to them, and eat osechi..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。ケイウンだと神殿じゃなくて社に\nお祈りするのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh right. In Keiun they pray at shrines instead of the cathedral."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で、「おせち」ってなんぞ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what's \"osechi\"?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "新年に食べる特別な料理だよ。\nそれぞれ長寿や色んな祈りが込められているんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a special meal eaten for the new year. Each dish contains wishes for longevity and other blessings."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにそれ！\u3000すっごく気になる！\nどんな料理なんだろ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! That sounds amazing! I wonder what kind of dishes they are..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケイウン特有の料理みたい。\nぜひ食べてみたいよね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems to be unique to Keiun cuisine. I'd love to try it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "オウヨッ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それから……\nえっと、バラバラになった顔を整える遊びとか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And then... um, there's a game where you put scattered faces back together?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにそれ、怖っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That sounds terrifying!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケイウンの文化をまた１つ体験できる機会だよ！\nお招きに与るってことでいいよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a chance to experience another part of Keiun's culture! We should accept the invitation, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もっちろん！\u3000あー、今から楽しみがすぎる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Absolutely! Ahh, I'm so excited already!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。いい年末年始になりそうだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. It's going to be a great new year!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「果ての大陸」を目指す腕利きの錬金術士。\n年末が近いため、アトリエでゆっくり過ごしている。",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A skilled alchemist aiming for World's End. With the year drawing to a close, she's relaxing at the atelier."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ・シュテルネンリヒト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna Sternenlicht"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「星の案内人」兼、錬金術士の少女。\nレスナと共に、アトリエでゆっくり過ごしている。",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A young woman who is both a Star Guide and an alchemist. She's spending time relaxing at the atelier with Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ・ジムロック",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina Zimlock"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]